            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOver a period of time, we\u2019ve been working on several client projects, and one of them came with a particularly interesting challenge: the need for extensive, custom form functionality. This gave us the perfect opportunity to explore how easy (or difficult) it actually is to extend Umbraco Forms.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://24days.in/umbraco-cms/2025/forms-extensions/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
